 "text": "Brief notes on the less obvious answers:\n\n- **Water drops (id …55052):** I assumed the fourth drop starts falling just as the first lands. The third drop has then fallen for T and the second for 2T, so the ratio is 1 : 2.\n- **Lenses (id …112341):** The combined power is +20 − 40 = −20. Negative power means the pair acts as a concave lens.\n- **Interferon (id …52050):** Interferon-gamma is produced by T-lymphocytes. The other options are wrong: its immunity is non-specific, it is a glycoprotein, and it acts against viruses rather than bacteria.\n- **Garbled question (id …83550):** The question text is incomplete, so option A is only a guess.\n- **Electron energy (id …36946):** I am not certain of this one; 4 MeV is my best recollection for beta particles.\n\n{\"answers\": {\"d1434736-45cb-4ab0-b13e-7fffa3399f39-11123\": \"A\", \"d2ce6f7f-8334-43d9-81e7-660e5df77d22-108840\": \"A\", \"d2d6e29d-9c35-4995-b9ed-285754d4e5e7-55052\": \"C\", \"d32a6b19-b0a3-4604-adbf-d8e06ea5ecb5-112278\": \"A\", \"d4f3b0b0-7ed5-453a-8a61-4c441627ab4b-86449\": \"C\", \"d6daaf2f-b7f3-4af6-8deb-7378bc3385e9-89044\": \"D\", \"d8095c85-ec19-4e06-9a2b-2fc9183d0b0a-52516\": \"A\", \"d8ae7fff-7391-432c-a7fd-96075feac86a-12653\": \"A\", \"daf64f16-cf4d-4ba0-baa0-2a6d44d17830-74796\": \"A\", \"ddb2f703-badc-4a59-a247-0c747bf676fd-130944\": \"A\", \"de736670-b77b-4db5-ac39-ef168fb1133d-112341\": \"A\", \"df0dbe70-0297-40e7-b41d-4db3011521f1-83550\": \"A\", \"df8467ff-43ff-44e6-bf42-9179c295fadc-36946\": \"B\", \"df89bfe9-3888-4345-9a8f-f7994c9ed42f-52050\": \"C\", \"dfc2dac1-b6e5-452e-a03a-c64fb4eb3c42-88382\": \"D\"}}",
